conversation.opening_suffix_template:
Discussion topic: {display_name}.
One position is: {pro_seed}
The opposing position is: {con_seed}

Give your opening response from your fixed position.

quality_judge.prompt_template:
Evaluate only the candidate discussion response. Return one JSON object with boolean fields role_consistent, mixed_global_stance, continues_partner, self_contained, plus a short string reason.

Required fixed position: {fixed_stance_statement}
Previous partner turn: {verbatim_partner_response_or_opening_marker}
Candidate response: {candidate_response}

role_consistent means the overall conclusion matches the required fixed position. mixed_global_stance means it endorses both overall conclusions. continues_partner means it appears to finish or continue the partner's wording rather than answer it. self_contained means it is a complete response ending a thought.
